    a: 'For now, nobody. A government memorandum of March 2026 proposed ANCOM as market surveillance authority and single point of contact, ASF and BNR for the financial sector, ANSPDCP for sensitive domains and ADR as notifying authority — but the document proposes rather than designates. In its statement of 24 July 2026, ANCOM notes that the authorities will be able to verify and sanction only after the national act, still being drafted, enters into force.',
